# hornet.px - aimed-shooter fighter
# canvas 20x20, 2 frames (pincer twitch, loop). Faces DOWN (nose at the bottom).
# narrow olive fuselage; short wings swept back to high tips; from each tip a 2 px prong sweeps
# FORWARD (down) and inward towards the nose, giving a horseshoe silhouette open to the front.
# red nose accent 2x2 at the front between the prongs. Frame b: prong tips close 1 px (pincer).
# light: top-left (left half lit, right half one olive step darker; red nose E/e lit, e/R shade).
# smallest must-read feature: red nose 2x2.
# anchor: frame centre (10,10).
# timing: a 167 ms, b 83 ms (quick snap).
palette
. transparent
E #ff8a86  red-3
K #0b0d1a  outline shared-dark
N #4f6852  olive-2
R #92203a  red-1
V #b9cfa2  olive-4
e #da3d4f  red-2
m #1b2622  olive-0
n #31443a  olive-1
v #7e9a78  olive-3
ramp olive m n N v V
ramp red R e E
frame a 167
